{#
settings/_signature_editor.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
One signature field: a contenteditable with a small format bar, wrapped in a
form that posts its HTML.

A contenteditable rather than a textarea of raw HTML, and specifically one
driven by `compose--compose-toolbar` — the SAME controller the compose window's
editor uses. Two reasons: the user sees what the recipient will see instead of
angle brackets, and bold here is bold there, because it is literally the same
code path (document.execCommand behind _exec()). The controller needs only its
`editor` and `hiddenInput` targets to work; everything else it looks for is
optional.

NO DISABLED STATE. This partial is only ever included for an address that has
a signature of its own; an address that inherits gets a one-line row instead
(see _signature.html.twig). The previous version rendered a greyed-out editor
for an inheriting alias and got the greying wrong on first render — the
markup set `data-signature-disabled`, which nothing in the stylesheet ever
matched, and only the checkbox's change handler added the `opacity-50` that
did the greying. So the field looked live until you toggled the box. There is
no state to get wrong now: no editor, no bug.

Whatever this posts is sanitised server-side before storage — see
SignatureController. The editor is a convenience, never a guarantee.

Variables:
  id         string   unique suffix for element ids
  action     string   route to post to
  token      string   CSRF token value
  signature  string   the stored HTML (may be empty)
  label      string   accessible name for the editor
  autofocus  bool     put the caret in the editor on load (the alias editor
                      revealed by "use a different signature" does)
#}
{% set autofocus = autofocus|default(false) %}

<form method="post" action="{{ action }}" data-turbo-stream
      data-controller="compose--compose-toolbar"
      class="mt-1">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ token }}">

    {# What is actually submitted. The contenteditable below is mirrored into
       it on every input by the toolbar controller's _syncHiddenInput(). #}
    <input type="hidden" name="signature" value="{{ signature|e('html_attr') }}"
           data-compose--compose-toolbar-target="hiddenInput">

    <div class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-0.5 border-b border-line bg-sunken px-1.5 py-1">
            {% set sb = "shrink-0 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover transition-colors" %}
            <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                    data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#bold"
                    title="{{ 'compose.bold'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.bold'|trans }}"
                    class="{{ sb }} font-bold">B</button>
            <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                    data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#italic"
                    title="{{ 'compose.italic'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.italic'|trans }}"
                    class="{{ sb }} italic">I</button>
            <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                    data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#underline"
                    title="{{ 'compose.underline'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.underline'|trans }}"
                    class="{{ sb }} underline">U</button>
            <div class="w-px h-4 bg-line mx-1"></div>
            <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                    data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#unorderedList"
                    title="{{ 'compose.list.unordered'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.list.unordered'|trans }}"
                    class="{{ sb }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-list-ul" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
            <button type="button" data-compose--compose-toolbar-action
                    data-action="click->compose--compose-toolbar#insertLink"
                    title="{{ 'compose.insert_link'|trans }}" aria-label="{{ 'compose.insert_link'|trans }}"
                    class="{{ sb }}"><i class="fa-solid fa-link" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>

        <div id="signature-editor-{{ id }}"
             data-compose--compose-toolbar-target="editor"
             contenteditable="true"
             {{ autofocus ? 'autofocus' : '' }}
             role="textbox"
             aria-multiline="true"
             aria-label="{{ label }}"
             data-placeholder="{{ 'settings.signature.placeholder'|trans }}"
             class="min-h-[64px] px-3 py-2 text-sm text-ink outline-none
                    empty:before:content-[attr(data-placeholder)]
                    empty:before:text-ink-faint
                    empty:before:pointer-events-none">{{ signature|raw }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex justify-end mt-1.5">
        <button type="submit"
                class="rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5
                       hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
            {{ 'settings.signature.save'|trans }}
        </button>
    </div>
</form>
